Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Live TV guide: the whole list opens on the channel it
 always did; opening's log lines only at an opening

- The whole list arriving over its first screenful keeps the rows where they are only when it
  would open on the same channel; otherwise it opens exactly as before.
- A playlist's update status is in no channel list: writing it no longer has the lists read again.
- The stage lines (groups, first channels, guide, programmes, logos) are logged only within
  30 s of opening the tab, and say "kept in memory" when nothing had to be read.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CeAGQc19KZMJTFxzJrjwSq
